"Chaos potential, or CP, is tied to being chosen by the System."
"Only Artonan wizards can tell who has it; humans cannot measure it."
"Humans know of it only because the System sometimes names it in skill descriptions."
"It is assumed to have a genetic or environmental part."
"High chaos potential means a being turns demonic as soon as corruption reaches a certain level."
"A being with high authority and high chaos potential becomes a very bad kind of demon."
"People with high chaos potential are barred from chaos-prone places like parts of Moon Thegund."
"Residents there are tested yearly, more often if their authority is high."
"On Earth chaos potential has only ever been a theory."
"One theory: the System selects those likely to turn demon on chaos exposure, and fixes the flaw."
